Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.9 11/12] i2c: cadence: Fix the hold bit setting
Date:   Mon, 11 Mar 2019 15:59:11 -0400
Message-Id: <20190311195912.139410-11-sashal@kernel.org>
